          "title": "You'll want to know: വിളിക്കൂ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വിളിക്കൂ (viḷikkū) — \"please call (someone)\", or \"please phone\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വിളിക്കൂ (viḷikkū) is native Dravidian, from the root \"to say, cry out, call\"; DEDR 5433 lists the root with Tamil viḷ."
            }
          ]
        },
