          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഭൂപടം (bhūpaṭaṁ) is built from Sanskrit parts: bhū, \"earth\" (CDIAL 9546), and paṭa, \"woven cloth\" (CDIAL 7692), which in Malayalam has come to mean a picture. A map is an earth-picture."
            }
          ]
        },
